[1mOptions[22m ([92mmandatory options marked with '*'[39m):
[92m  -in <file>*                                                        [39mInput file[96m[39m[95m (valid formats: 'mzML')[39m
[92m  -out <file>*                                                       [39mOutput file[96m[39m[95m (valid formats: 'featureXML')[39m
