                                                                     [96m[39m[95m[39m

  -faims_merge_features <true/false>                                 For FAIMS data with multiple compensation voltages: Merge features representing the same analyte detected at different CV values into a single feature. Only features with DIFFERENT FAIMS CV values are merged (same CV = different analytes). Has no effect on non-FAIMS data.[96m (default: 'true')[39m[95m (valid: 'true', 'false')[39m
